body:
No reason not to expand the "allow" mechanism [described here](https://github.com/simonw/datasette/blob/86dec9e8fffd6c4efec928ae9b5713748dec7e74/docs/authentication.rst#permissions-for-canned-queries) to the root of `metadata.json` plus to databases and tables.

Refs #810 and #800.

```json
{
    "databases": {
        "mydatabase": {
            "allow": {
                "id": ["root"]
            }
        }
    }
}
```

